  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given an array AAA of NNN integers, and a positive parameter XXX.\n\nYou may perform the following action as many times as you want (possibly 000):\n\n\nChoose iii (1≤i≤N)(1 \\le i \\le N)(1≤i≤N) and modify AiA_iAi​ to Ai+XA_i + XAi​+X.\nFind the minimum possible value of A1⊕A2⊕…⊕ANA_1 \\oplus A_2 \\oplus \\ldots \\oplus A_NA1​⊕A2​⊕…⊕AN​ at the end of the actions, where ⊕\\oplus⊕ denotes the Bitwise XOR operator.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of multiple lines of input.\n\nThe first line of each test case contains NNN and XXX - the size of the array, and the parameter.\nThe second line contains NNN integers - A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output on a new line the minimum value of  A1⊕A2⊕…⊕ANA_1 \\oplus A_2 \\oplus \\ldots \\oplus A_NA1​⊕A2​⊕…⊕AN​ after performing some actions.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1041 \\le T \\le 10^41≤T≤104",
      "1≤N≤2⋅1051 \\le N \\le 2 \\cdot 10^51≤N≤2⋅105",
      "1≤Ai,X&lt;2301 \\le A_i, X \\lt 2^{30}1≤Ai​,X&lt;230",
      "The sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 2⋅1052 \\cdot 10^52⋅105."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "3\n2 2\n1 100\n3 1\n1 2 3\n1 1\n100",
        "output": "1\n0\n100",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1 : Add X=2X = 2X=2 to A1A_1A1​ 505050 times. This changes the array AAA to [101,100][101, 100][101,100], and 101⊕100=1101 \\oplus 100 = 1101⊕100=1.\nTest Case 2 : A1⊕A2⊕A3=1⊕2⊕3=0A_1 \\oplus A_2 \\oplus A_3 = 1 \\oplus 2 \\oplus 3 = 0A1​⊕A2​⊕A3​=1⊕2⊕3=0 already before any actions."
      }
    ]
  },
